---
import Footer from "@components/Footer.astro";
import Navbar from "@components/Navbar.astro";
import Base from "@layouts/Base.astro";
import "@styles/global.css";
import "@styles/tokens.css";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy — Nimbus"
  description="How Nimbus collects, uses, and protects your information."
>
  <Navbar />
  <main id="main-content" class="legal-page">
    <div class="container">
      <a class="back-link" href="/">
        <svg
          width="14"
          height="14"
          viewBox="0 0 16 16"
          fill="none"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path
            d="M10 3L5 8l5 5"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.6"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
        </svg>
        Back to Nimbus
      </a>

      <article class="legal-article">
        <header class="legal-header">
          <p class="section-label">Legal</p>
          <h1 class="legal-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
          <p class="legal-date">Last updated: 28 July 2026</p>
        </header>

        <div class="legal-body">
          <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
          <p>
            Nimbus is a free, open-source WordPress plugin for cloud media
            offloading. We are reachable at <a
              href="mailto:hello@usenimbus.dev">hello@usenimbus.dev</a
            >. When this policy says "Nimbus", "we", "us", or "our" it refers to
            the maintainers of the Nimbus plugin and the website usenimbus.dev.
          </p>

          <h2>2. The plugin does not phone home</h2>
          <p>
            Nimbus has no license server, no account system, and no telemetry.
            The plugin does not send any data — settings, usage statistics, or
            otherwise — to us or to any Nimbus-operated service. The only
            outbound network calls the plugin makes are directly from your own
            server to the storage provider (Amazon S3, Cloudflare R2, etc.) and
            cache provider you configure yourself, using credentials you enter
            and control. We never see your storage credentials, your media
            files, or any data about your site's visitors.
          </p>

          <h2>3. Information collected by this website</h2>
          <p>
            The Nimbus marketing/documentation website (usenimbus.dev) does not
            use advertising or analytics tracking cookies. Our web server
            temporarily records standard HTTP logs (IP address, browser, page
            requested, timestamp) for debugging and security purposes; these
            are not retained beyond 30 days and are not linked to any other
            data we hold.
          </p>
          <p>
            If you email us for support, we retain that correspondence only as
            long as needed to resolve your request.
          </p>

          <h2>4. Data sharing</h2>
          <p>
            We do not sell, rent, or trade personal data, and we have no
            advertising or analytics partners that receive personal data. We
            have no payment processor, since Nimbus has no paid tier.
          </p>

          <h2>5. Third-party services you configure</h2>
          <p>
            When you connect Nimbus to a storage provider or cache provider,
            your data is transmitted directly between your WordPress site and
            that provider under their own privacy policy and terms — not
            through any Nimbus-operated infrastructure.
          </p>

          <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
          <p>
            Since we hold no account or license data about you, there is
            generally nothing for us to access, correct, delete, or export
            beyond the website's short-lived server logs described above and
            any support email correspondence. If you have a specific concern,
            email <a href="mailto:hello@usenimbus.dev">hello@usenimbus.dev</a>.
          </p>

          <h2>7. Children's privacy</h2>
          <p>
            Nimbus is a developer tool and is not directed at children under the
            age of 16. We do not knowingly collect personal data from children.
          </p>

          <h2>8. Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this policy to reflect changes in our practices or for
            legal reasons. When we do, we will update the "last updated" date at
            the top of this page.
          </p>

          <h2>9. Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Questions about this policy? Email <a
              href="mailto:hello@usenimbus.dev">hello@usenimbus.dev</a
            >.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 3.5rem 0 7rem;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.375rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--nmb-text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    transition: color var(--nmb-t);
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--nmb-text);
  }

  /* ── Article ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .legal-article {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .legal-header {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--nmb-border-light);
  }

  .legal-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: -0.028em;
    color: var(--nmb-text);
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0.25rem;
  }

  .legal-date {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--nmb-text-subtle);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── Body typography ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .legal-body h2 {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    color: var(--nmb-text);
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin: 2.25rem 0 0.625rem;
  }

  .legal-body p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--nmb-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0 0 0.875rem;
  }

  .legal-body ul {
    margin: 0 0 0.875rem 1.25rem;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .legal-body li {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--nmb-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .legal-body strong {
    color: var(--nmb-text-2);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .legal-body code {
    font-family: var(--nmb-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.875em;
    color: var(--nmb-accent);
    background: var(--nmb-accent-dim);
    padding: 0.1em 0.35em;
    border-radius: var(--nmb-radius-xs);
  }

  .legal-body a {
    color: var(--nmb-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .legal-body a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
